nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Orcsoberfest Island</b> is the location where the <a href=\"#/quest/orcsoberfest\">Orcsoberfest</a> event takes place, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33771,31059,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33771, 31059, 7)</a>. To access it use a teleport just south of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32361,32294,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32361, 32294, 7)</a>). <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Great%20Schnitzel\">The Great Schnitzel</a>'s lair is also located under this island. \n</p><p>This island shares a location with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Percht%20Island\">Percht Island</a>, which is why it may look odd on the Automap if the player has visited both places. Which area is active depends on the event that is running. You can see the map that corresponds only to the Orcsoberfest Island on the images to the right. The region that hosts the island is called Secluded Island, and that's the name that appears in e.g. the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Bestiary</a> of the creatures.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Xaver\">Xaver</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Xaver\"><img alt=\"Xaver\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Xaver_0fd269.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"widt